{"id":"torrey:resurrection-the","source":"torrey","name":"Resurrection, The","slug":"resurrection-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"A doctrine of the Old Testament — Job 19:26; Ps 16:10; 49:15; Isa 26:19; Da 12:2; Ho 13:14.","refs":[["Job",19,26,19,26],["Ps",16,10,16,10],["Ps",49,15,49,15],["Isa",26,19,26,19],["Dan",12,2,12,2],["Hos",13,14,13,14]]},{"text":"A first principle of the gospel — 1Co 15:13,14; Heb 6:1,2.","refs":[["1Cor",15,13,15,13],["1Cor",15,14,15,14],["Heb",6,1,6,1],["Heb",6,2,6,2]]},{"text":"Expected by the Jews — Joh 11:24; Heb 11:35.","refs":[["John",11,24,11,24],["Heb",11,35,11,35]]},{"text":"Denied by the Sadducees — Mt 22:23; Lu 20:27; Ac 23:8.","refs":[["Matt",22,23,22,23],["Luke",20,27,20,27],["Acts",23,8,23,8]]},{"text":"Explained away by false teachers — 2Ti 2:18.","refs":[["2Tim",2,18,2,18]]},{"text":"Called in question by some in the church — 1Co 15:12.","refs":[["1Cor",15,12,15,12]]},{"text":"Is not incredible — Mr 12:24; Ac 26:8.","refs":[["Mark",12,24,12,24],["Acts",26,8,26,8]]},{"text":"Is not contrary to reason — Joh 12:24; 1Co 15:35-49.","refs":[["John",12,24,12,24],["1Cor",15,35,15,49]]},{"text":"Assumed and proved by our Lord — Mt 22:29-32; Lu 14:14; Joh 5:28,29.","refs":[["Matt",22,29,22,32],["Luke",14,14,14,14],["John",5,28,5,28],["John",5,29,5,29]]},{"text":"Preached by the Apostles — Ac 4:2; 17:18; 24:15.","refs":[["Acts",4,2,4,2],["Acts",17,18,17,18],["Acts",24,15,24,15]]},{"text":"Credibility of, shown by the resurrection of individuals — Mt 9:25; 27:53; Lu 7:14; Joh 11:44; Heb 11:35.","refs":[["Matt",9,25,9,25],["Matt",27,53,27,53],["Luke",7,14,7,14],["John",11,44,11,44],["Heb",11,35,11,35]]},{"text":"Certainty of, proved by the resurrection of Christ — 1Co 15:12-20.","refs":[["1Cor",15,12,15,20]]},{"text":"God. — Mt 22:29.","refs":[["Matt",22,29,22,29]]},{"text":"Christ. — Joh 5:28,29; 6:39,40,44.","refs":[["John",5,28,5,28],["John",5,29,5,29],["John",6,39,6,39],["John",6,40,6,40],["John",6,44,6,44]]},{"text":"The Holy Spirit. — Ro 8:11.","refs":[["Rom",8,11,8,11]]},{"text":"Shall be of all the dead — Joh 5:28; Ac 24:15; Re 20:13.","refs":[["John",5,28,5,28],["Acts",24,15,24,15],["Rev",20,13,20,13]]},{"text":"Rise through Christ. — Joh 11:25; Ac 4:2; 1Co 15:21,22.","refs":[["John",11,25,11,25],["Acts",4,2,4,2],["1Cor",15,21,15,21],["1Cor",15,22,15,22]]},{"text":"Rise first. — 1Co 15:23; 1Th 4:16.","refs":[["1Cor",15,23,15,23],["1Thess",4,16,4,16]]},{"text":"Rise to eternal life. — Da 12:2; Joh 5:29.","refs":[["Dan",12,2,12,2],["John",5,29,5,29]]},{"text":"Be glorified with Christ. — Col 3:4.","refs":[["Col",3,4,3,4]]},{"text":"Be as the angels. — Mt 22:30.","refs":[["Matt",22,30,22,30]]},{"text":"Have incorruptible bodies. — 1Co 15:42.","refs":[["1Cor",15,42,15,42]]},{"text":"Have glorious bodies. — 1Co 15:43.","refs":[["1Cor",15,43,15,43]]},{"text":"Have powerful bodies. — 1Co 15:43.","refs":[["1Cor",15,43,15,43]]},{"text":"Have spiritual bodies. — 1Co 15:44.","refs":[["1Cor",15,44,15,44]]},{"text":"Have bodies like Christ’s. — Php 3:21; 1Jo 3:2.","refs":[["Phil",3,21,3,21],["1John",3,2,3,2]]},{"text":"Be recompensed. — Lu 14:14.","refs":[["Luke",14,14,14,14]]},{"text":"Saints should look forward to — Da 12:13; Php 3:11; 2Co 5:1.","refs":[["Dan",12,13,12,13],["Phil",3,11,3,11],["2Cor",5,1,5,1]]},{"text":"Of saints shall be followed by the change of those then alive — 1Co 15:51; 1Th 4:17.","refs":[["1Cor",15,51,15,51],["1Thess",4,17,4,17]]},{"text":"Mocking. — Ac 17:32.","refs":[["Acts",17,32,17,32]]},{"text":"Persecution. — Ac 23:6; 24:11-15.","refs":[["Acts",23,6,23,6],["Acts",24,11,24,15]]},{"text":"Blessedness of those who have part in the first — Re 20:6.","refs":[["Rev",20,6,20,6]]},{"text":"Shame and everlasting contempt. — Da 12:2.","refs":[["Dan",12,2,12,2]]},{"text":"Damnation. — Joh 5:29.","refs":[["John",5,29,5,29]]},{"text":"Illustrative of the new birth — Joh 5:25.","refs":[["John",5,25,5,25]]},{"text":"Illustrated — Eze 37:1-10; 1Co 15:36,37.","refs":[["Ezek",37,1,3